EnemyChase(Normal){

  * (Normal):
  | Got(A) ? Rest :(Angry)
  | Got(D) ? Rest :(Happy)

  | Cell(F,V) & Cell(L,V) & Cell(R,V) ? 80% Move(F) / 10% Turn(L) / 10% Turn(R) :(Normal)
  | Cell(F,V) & Cell(L,V) ? 88% Move(F) / 12% Turn(L) :(Normal)
  | Cell(F,V) & Cell(R,V) ? 88% Move(F) / 12% Turn(R) :(Normal)

  | Cell(F,V) ? Move(F) :(Normal)

  | Cell(L,V) & Cell(R,V) ? 50% Turn(L) / 50% Turn(R) :(Normal)
  | Cell(L,V) ? Turn(L) :(Normal)
  | Cell(R,V) ? Turn(R) :(Normal)

  | Cell(B,V) ? Turn(B) :(Normal)
  | True ? Rest :(Normal)


  * (Happy):
  | Got(A) ? Rest :(Angry)
  | ! Got(D) ? Rest :(Normal)

  | Cell(F,V) & Cell(L,V) & Cell(R,V) ? 85% Move(F) / 8% Turn(L) / 7% Turn(R) :(Happy)
  | Cell(F,V) & Cell(L,V) ? 90% Move(F) / 10% Turn(L) :(Happy)
  | Cell(F,V) & Cell(R,V) ? 90% Move(F) / 10% Turn(R) :(Happy)

  | Cell(F,V) ? Move(F) :(Happy)

  | Cell(L,V) & Cell(R,V) ? 50% Turn(L) / 50% Turn(R) :(Happy)
  | Cell(L,V) ? Turn(L) :(Happy)
  | Cell(R,V) ? Turn(R) :(Happy)

  | Cell(B,V) ? Turn(B) :(Happy)
  | True ? Rest :(Happy)


  * (Angry):
  | ! Got(A) ? Rest :(Normal)

  | Closest(@,F) & Cell(F,V) ? Move(F) :(Angry)

  | Closest(@,L) & Cell(L,V) & ! Cell(F,V) ? Turn(L) :(Angry)
  | Closest(@,R) & Cell(R,V) & ! Cell(F,V) ? Turn(R) :(Angry)

  | Closest(@,L) & Cell(L,V) & Cell(F,V) ? 65% Turn(L) / 35% Move(F) :(Angry)
  | Closest(@,R) & Cell(R,V) & Cell(F,V) ? 65% Turn(R) / 35% Move(F) :(Angry)

  | Cell(F,V) & Cell(L,V) & Cell(R,V) ? 88% Move(F) / 6% Turn(L) / 6% Turn(R) :(Angry)
  | Cell(F,V) & Cell(L,V) ? 92% Move(F) / 8% Turn(L) :(Angry)
  | Cell(F,V) & Cell(R,V) ? 92% Move(F) / 8% Turn(R) :(Angry)

  | Cell(F,V) ? Move(F) :(Angry)

  | Closest(@,L) & Cell(L,V) ? Turn(L) :(Angry)
  | Closest(@,R) & Cell(R,V) ? Turn(R) :(Angry)

  | Cell(L,V) & Cell(R,V) ? 50% Turn(L) / 50% Turn(R) :(Angry)
  | Cell(L,V) ? Turn(L) :(Angry)
  | Cell(R,V) ? Turn(R) :(Angry)

  | Closest(@,B) & Cell(B,V) ? Turn(B) :(Angry)
  | Cell(B,V) ? Turn(B) :(Angry)

  | True ? Rest :(Angry)
}